{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40879","headline":"诸暨五泄山 · 周镛","name":"诸暨五泄山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路入苍烟九过溪，九穿岩曲到招提。\n天分五溜寒倾北，地秀诸峰翠插西。\n凿径破崖来木杪，驾泉鸣竹落榱题。\n当年老默无消息，犹有词堂一杖藜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周镛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}